Contract "1" -- "1" InsuranceProduct : covers
Contract "1" -- "0..*" ClaimCase : generates
Offer "0..*" -- "1" Customer : made to
Offer "0..*" -- "1" InsuranceProduct : for
Offer "0..*" -- "1" Contract : becomes
ClaimCase "1" *-- "1..*" EstimatorReport : contains
Estimator "1" -- "*" EstimatorReport : issues
ClaimCase "1" -- "0..1" Compensation : results in
Compensation "1" -- "1" Customer : paid to

@enduml

